WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.120
|||||\\\\\\\\\\\\\

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.120
Release-Group "Mania" presents
doramamania

00:00:25.560 --> 01:13:29.300
Mania

00:00:38.100 --> 00:00:43.020
Alchemy

00:00:38.100 --> 00:00:43.020
Shower

00:01:15.770 --> 00:01:19.110
I heard you went fishing with Uk

00:01:20.150 --> 00:01:23.400
Yes. It's boring to fish alone

00:01:24.150 --> 00:01:25.950
You once said

00:01:26.030 --> 00:01:29.450
that Chan Wook has the same fate as Master Seo Kyung

00:01:29.540 --> 00:01:33.000
Is that why you support him and help him?

00:01:33.500 --> 00:01:36.420
I'm not the only one helping him

00:01:38.710 --> 00:01:40.960
Is anyone else directing him?

00:01:41.920 --> 00:01:43.420
Who?

00:01:44.170 --> 00:01:45.840
Do you know this person?

00:01:52.520 --> 00:01:56.150
No one teaches Uka how to cast spells

00:01:56.650 --> 00:01:57.650
I'm sure

00:01:58.230 --> 00:02:00.940
This was confirmed by his maid

00:02:01.690 --> 00:02:05.820
That is, he himself reached such heights?

00:02:05.900 --> 00:02:07.870
Perhaps he became the magician of Jeonjingak

00:02:07.950 --> 00:02:10.330
thanks to tricks and luck

00:02:10.410 --> 00:02:11.910
But he has no skills

00:02:11.990 --> 00:02:14.790
I'm sure you heard about our argument

00:02:16.170 --> 00:02:17.500
One fight left

00:02:19.210 --> 00:02:20.250
You're right

00:02:20.340 --> 00:02:23.880
The teacher would have prevented his humiliation

00:02:24.550 --> 00:02:27.090
After reading "Words of the Heart", he received respect

00:02:27.180 --> 00:02:29.180
And our argument humiliated him

00:02:29.260 --> 00:02:32.770
He stubbornly continues to fight

00:02:32.850 --> 00:02:34.430
So this is

00:02:35.560 --> 00:02:38.310
means a lot to him

00:02:41.690 --> 00:02:43.440
Are you okay? Can you see?

00:02:43.530 --> 00:02:45.400
Yes. And you, master?

00:02:45.490 --> 00:02:47.570
Are you unharmed?

00:02:47.140 --> 00:02:52.140
Project coordinator and editor: Ria_Lee

00:02:49.200 --> 00:02:50.280
You're right

00:02:51.950 --> 00:02:55.200
I had no idea how significant jade could be to him.

00:02:52.140 --> 00:02:57.140
Assistant coordinators: Martini, gaarysn

00:02:57.140 --> 00:03:02.140
Typesetter translators: Ria_Lee, tommo

00:02:59.500 --> 00:03:01.040
As soon as Uk returns,

00:03:01.710 --> 00:03:03.960
Bom wants to fight

00:03:04.050 --> 00:03:05.420
Does he fish?

00:03:06.300 --> 00:03:08.510
And Moo Deok turns a blind eye to this?

00:03:09.640 --> 00:03:11.140
I don't think she's happy about this

00:03:11.220 --> 00:03:14.720
So you also noticed that Wook listens to her

00:03:14.810 --> 00:03:18.770
He is stubborn no matter what anyone tells him

00:03:18.850 --> 00:03:20.810
But he always listens to Moo Deok

00:03:23.860 --> 00:03:26.610
We can protect the monsters from this world

00:03:28.450 --> 00:03:30.410
He spoke then about Nak Su

00:03:32.950 --> 00:03:37.370
If he's looking for a stone to protect her...

00:03:39.920 --> 00:03:42.380
- They can't be together
- What?

00:03:43.670 --> 00:03:44.710
Why?

00:03:44.800 --> 00:03:47.460
Don't you like how close they are?

00:03:49.840 --> 00:03:50.840
That's not the point

00:03:51.340 --> 00:03:54.720
If they choose the wrong path,

00:03:56.930 --> 00:03:59.390
I can't help you

00:04:08.360 --> 00:04:14.450
Uk can bring chaos to this world

00:04:15.580 --> 00:04:19.460
What if our support makes it uncontrollable,

00:04:19.540 --> 00:04:22.000
After what will he attract attention?

00:04:22.080 --> 00:04:25.420
Are you afraid that he will encroach on the throne and bring

00:04:25.500 --> 00:04:28.590
devastation in Daeho?

00:04:30.090 --> 00:04:33.340
This is possible if he follows the King's star

00:04:33.930 --> 00:04:35.890
This will broaden his horizons

00:04:35.970 --> 00:04:40.520
and the desire to achieve greatness

00:04:42.270 --> 00:04:43.310
Jin

00:04:44.310 --> 00:04:46.900
How long did it take you to master Chisa?

00:04:47.730 --> 00:04:48.690
Chisu?

00:04:49.190 --> 00:04:52.320
I quickly mastered Ryusa,

00:04:52.400 --> 00:04:56.580
but it was more difficult to master Chisa

00:05:01.910 --> 00:05:04.710
For three years I studied to comprehend the energy of heaven

00:05:05.830 --> 00:05:08.460
It took three years to harness the energy of the earth

00:05:09.630 --> 00:05:14.300
and four years to feel the energy around

00:05:16.430 --> 00:05:20.430
The energy of heaven, earth and water that flows between them

00:05:21.310 --> 00:05:24.310
I mastered all this for ten years

00:05:26.480 --> 00:05:28.360
and comprehended Chisa

00:05:28.440 --> 00:05:29.530
Impressive

00:05:30.610 --> 00:05:32.320
It took me 13 years

00:05:32.400 --> 00:05:34.700
Yeom took twice as long to learn everything

00:05:35.320 --> 00:05:39.240
I was second after Chang Gan

00:05:39.740 --> 00:05:40.910
Only now...

00:05:48.590 --> 00:05:52.210
We see the energy that flows between heaven and earth,

00:05:52.300 --> 00:05:55.720
but essentially it's just water

00:05:58.100 --> 00:06:02.560
We've been trying to master this for years

00:06:04.390 --> 00:06:06.940
But there are those who can do this from birth

00:06:24.160 --> 00:06:26.620
Simply put, geniuses

00:06:27.500 --> 00:06:29.710
But the rest of the world

00:06:29.790 --> 00:06:33.510
considers them reckless, unreliable

00:06:33.590 --> 00:06:36.220
and sometimes dangerous

00:06:39.510 --> 00:06:40.600
What am I...

00:06:41.720 --> 00:06:43.310
mastered Chisu?

00:06:46.440 --> 00:06:49.100
Because they are different from the rest

00:06:56.820 --> 00:06:59.070
Some people envy them

00:07:06.910 --> 00:07:09.330
Others are afraid of them

00:07:12.000 --> 00:07:13.420
I'll definitely win tomorrow

00:07:16.170 --> 00:07:17.470
I caught her

00:07:19.840 --> 00:07:21.010
Really?

00:07:21.680 --> 00:07:22.760
Chan Wook

00:07:23.850 --> 00:07:25.060
You have mastered Chisa

00:07:30.310 --> 00:07:34.900
We react this way because we don't know how they use their incredible power.

00:07:35.530 --> 00:07:39.530
Will he save the world like Master Seo Kyung?

00:07:39.610 --> 00:07:42.990
or will it destroy? We don't know

00:07:44.200 --> 00:07:45.620
In other words,

00:07:46.950 --> 00:07:50.000
will you continue to watch him?

00:07:51.830 --> 00:07:55.130
Don't worry. I understand everything

00:07:57.380 --> 00:07:59.340
If you have to get rid of this power,

00:08:00.550 --> 00:08:03.100
I will do it with my own hands

00:08:10.060 --> 00:08:11.980
Chan Wook, is your punishment over?

00:08:12.060 --> 00:08:13.310
That's why I came back

00:08:13.400 --> 00:08:14.820
So you destroyed Jeonbugwan?

00:08:14.900 --> 00:08:16.150
Don't exaggerate

00:08:17.280 --> 00:08:20.030
- Hey
- You're finally back

00:08:20.740 --> 00:08:23.660
I'm your last opponent

00:08:24.320 --> 00:08:26.660
- I see
- It's a pity that you won't win,

00:08:27.700 --> 00:08:31.920
I'll fight with you once

00:08:37.380 --> 00:08:38.800
Don't worry so much

00:08:39.460 --> 00:08:41.880
I hope the last fight will be interesting

00:08:42.720 --> 00:08:43.800
I'm counting on you

00:08:53.770 --> 00:08:55.230
What was that?

00:08:55.310 --> 00:08:57.070
Did he learn anything new?

00:08:57.150 --> 00:08:59.070
I heard he was just fishing

00:08:59.150 --> 00:09:01.570
Don't worry, he's just being brave

00:09:02.610 --> 00:09:06.780
I will embarrass him in front of the Crown Prince

00:09:08.830 --> 00:09:09.950
Your Highness

00:09:10.750 --> 00:09:13.540
My stupid master lost nine times

00:09:13.620 --> 00:09:17.420
why did you lose nine golden toads?

00:09:18.050 --> 00:09:20.380
I don't dare look you in the eyes

00:09:22.760 --> 00:09:24.220
Last fight left?

00:09:24.300 --> 00:09:26.090
He trained hard

00:09:26.180 --> 00:09:28.510
so as not to disappoint you this time

00:09:28.600 --> 00:09:30.220
So that I don't get disappointed

00:09:30.810 --> 00:09:31.890
he must lose

00:09:36.480 --> 00:09:39.070
You took me for a fool

00:09:39.150 --> 00:09:42.190
Used my gold to train her master

00:09:43.740 --> 00:09:45.320
Thanks to the duel

00:09:45.410 --> 00:09:49.240
you had the pleasure of watching the owner’s humiliation

00:09:49.330 --> 00:09:51.910
I'm sure it was worth the gold

00:09:52.750 --> 00:09:54.410
Well yeah, it was fun

00:09:54.500 --> 00:09:56.670
I hope he loses again

00:09:57.460 --> 00:10:00.000
so that you cry, having lost your jade

00:10:00.670 --> 00:10:02.880
Chan Wook has the other half, right?

00:10:03.670 --> 00:10:06.130
He gave you a second one

00:10:06.220 --> 00:10:08.390
does this mean it is a symbol of love?

00:10:10.760 --> 00:10:12.560
Did you give it to me to use me?

00:10:16.650 --> 00:10:19.310
If Uk loses,

00:10:19.900 --> 00:10:20.980
I will destroy the jade

00:10:22.440 --> 00:10:23.900
You must lose something

00:10:24.400 --> 00:10:25.860
What a shame

00:10:25.950 --> 00:10:28.240
Your quivering love will sink into oblivion

00:10:33.540 --> 00:10:34.960
Do as you please

00:10:35.910 --> 00:10:37.330
Jade completed his task

00:10:37.420 --> 00:10:39.580
Forced the owner to go through 10 fights

00:10:39.670 --> 00:10:42.710
You said that you would risk your life for jade

00:10:43.960 --> 00:10:46.470
If we can risk our lives for our feelings,

00:10:47.880 --> 00:10:51.220
losing this stone will not affect them

00:10:58.400 --> 00:11:00.980
So you don't care if you lose him or not?

00:11:02.190 --> 00:11:03.280
Okay

00:11:04.280 --> 00:11:05.690
Then I'll throw it away

00:11:16.160 --> 00:11:17.750
So he really doesn't mean anything

00:11:18.790 --> 00:11:20.880
You deceived me

00:11:20.960 --> 00:11:23.250
Said it was the most valuable thing

00:11:23.340 --> 00:11:26.170
And if you don't worry about her, then you lied

00:11:27.380 --> 00:11:29.590
How will you pay for a lie?

00:11:29.680 --> 00:11:31.430
You're risking your life, right?

00:11:32.100 --> 00:11:33.220
Excellent

00:11:34.060 --> 00:11:36.730
This time it's you at stake

00:11:38.600 --> 00:11:40.690
I've already lost nine toads

00:11:41.310 --> 00:11:42.770
I don't want to lose another one

00:11:42.860 --> 00:11:44.610
You will be the reward

00:11:45.900 --> 00:11:47.190
in this fight

00:11:49.570 --> 00:11:51.200
As you order

00:11:51.280 --> 00:11:52.450
If Chang Wook loses,

00:11:53.410 --> 00:11:56.370
you will become the winner's maid

00:11:57.620 --> 00:12:00.920
Yes, I'll think about it

00:12:16.770 --> 00:12:19.600
So are you Chan Wook's last opponent?

00:12:20.980 --> 00:12:22.600
I'm Cha Bum

00:12:22.690 --> 00:12:24.400
I will win no matter what

00:12:25.440 --> 00:12:27.190
You should

00:12:27.280 --> 00:12:28.820
If you lose

00:12:28.900 --> 00:12:31.570
I will make sure that you will not succeed as a magician

00:12:33.410 --> 00:12:35.330
Can you give your word?

00:12:36.580 --> 00:12:39.620
There is always a possibility...

00:12:39.700 --> 00:12:40.830
Enough!

00:12:41.960 --> 00:12:44.250
I need someone who is sure to win

00:12:44.330 --> 00:12:45.710
Give me your word

00:12:45.790 --> 00:12:48.340
I'm afraid I can't, Your Highness

00:12:48.420 --> 00:12:50.090
Nobody but him...

00:12:51.930 --> 00:12:53.470
won't give this word

00:12:55.100 --> 00:12:58.520
There's only one person left

00:12:59.600 --> 00:13:01.180
who can win

00:13:01.270 --> 00:13:02.270
Seo Yul

00:13:08.230 --> 00:13:09.480
Seo Yul?

00:13:22.120 --> 00:13:24.250
The dispute was nothing serious

00:13:25.080 --> 00:13:27.090
But he annoys me

00:13:27.170 --> 00:13:31.670
I lost nine toads to put Uka in his place

00:13:32.260 --> 00:13:35.640
Imagine how funny I'll look

00:13:35.720 --> 00:13:39.600
if he wins the last fight

00:13:41.140 --> 00:13:43.730
So I need someone who is sure to win

00:13:43.810 --> 00:13:46.480
You are the best magician of Jeongjingak and my cousin

00:13:46.560 --> 00:13:48.020
I'm sure you're the only one

00:13:49.690 --> 00:13:52.990
I know you are friends with him

00:13:54.740 --> 00:13:58.160
But like a prince and your cousin,

00:13:58.910 --> 00:14:00.490
I ask for your help

00:14:04.330 --> 00:14:05.620
Okay, Your Highness

00:14:07.920 --> 00:14:08.750
Really?

00:14:09.920 --> 00:14:11.880
Will you fight him?

00:14:12.460 --> 00:14:13.670
I'll win

00:14:14.380 --> 00:14:15.840
I give you my word

00:14:17.010 --> 00:14:20.470
Exactly. Out of everyone, only you can

00:14:20.560 --> 00:14:22.930
Moo Deok really promised to serve

00:14:23.020 --> 00:14:24.850
to the winner?

00:14:24.930 --> 00:14:27.560
Yes, instead of toads she put

00:14:32.610 --> 00:14:34.650
bet yourself

00:14:34.740 --> 00:14:36.700
Then I will defeat Uka

00:14:38.070 --> 00:14:39.820
and I will make her my maid

00:14:44.370 --> 00:14:45.500
Okay

00:14:46.120 --> 00:14:48.540
Chan Wook's last opponent, come forward

00:15:16.820 --> 00:15:17.820
Chan Wook,

00:15:18.910 --> 00:15:20.780
fight with you today

00:15:21.490 --> 00:15:22.740
I'll be there

00:15:42.010 --> 00:15:45.010
Is So Yul fighting with him to let him win?

00:15:45.100 --> 00:15:46.100
Yes no

00:15:46.180 --> 00:15:49.270
When Dan Gu volunteered, Chang Wook gave in immediately

00:15:49.350 --> 00:15:50.770
He won't let Wook win

00:15:50.850 --> 00:15:54.400
He gave the prince his word that he would defeat Chan Wook

00:15:58.650 --> 00:15:59.900
Get started

00:16:14.920 --> 00:16:16.210
Yul was right

00:16:16.920 --> 00:16:19.090
Uk has improved a lot

00:16:34.110 --> 00:16:35.520
This is my protection spell

00:16:35.610 --> 00:16:36.730
When did he master it?

00:16:38.570 --> 00:16:41.320
He learned everything he saw in previous fights

00:16:41.400 --> 00:16:45.330
Has he mastered the spells of previous opponents?

00:16:45.410 --> 00:16:49.160
He learned the spells he saw and repeats them

00:17:49.220 --> 00:17:50.350
He did it

00:18:26.340 --> 00:18:27.840
The fight is over

00:18:27.930 --> 00:18:30.430
Seo Yul won

00:18:34.560 --> 00:18:35.690
I knew it

00:18:37.100 --> 00:18:39.900
Uk lost all ten fights

00:18:40.690 --> 00:18:43.650
How did he use Tansa at the end?

00:18:43.740 --> 00:18:46.780
He collected energy in the air and turned it into water

00:18:46.860 --> 00:18:47.780
Don't be funny

00:18:48.700 --> 00:18:51.410
Only those who own Chisu can do this

00:19:03.840 --> 00:19:05.210
When did you master Chisa?

00:19:05.800 --> 00:19:09.510
I said yesterday that I would tell you something amazing

00:19:09.590 --> 00:19:11.050
It was great

00:19:11.850 --> 00:19:13.220
Congratulations

00:19:13.310 --> 00:19:14.180
Chan Wook!

00:19:15.180 --> 00:19:17.640
You have mastered Chisa. Congratulations, buddy!

00:19:18.650 --> 00:19:19.600
Have you seen?

00:19:20.230 --> 00:19:22.940
Our Chan Wook has mastered Chisa!

00:19:24.280 --> 00:19:26.030
- Is it true?
- Hey

00:19:26.110 --> 00:19:28.070
- Congratulations
- Congratulations

00:19:28.150 --> 00:19:30.620
- Amazing
- Congratulations

00:19:30.700 --> 00:19:31.780
Hey

00:19:32.950 --> 00:19:34.450
It's time to go to Saejukwon

00:19:43.750 --> 00:19:46.210
Moo Deok left with the prince

00:19:46.800 --> 00:19:49.470
They're probably discussing ending the dispute.

00:19:49.550 --> 00:19:52.220
I'm just worried they'll do something like that again

00:19:52.300 --> 00:19:53.970
I'll check

00:19:54.060 --> 00:19:57.560
Yes. Take care of her. You are her owner now

00:20:01.690 --> 00:20:04.110
That's what we want the prince to think

00:20:06.150 --> 00:20:08.780
Seo Yul, go to Moo Deok

00:20:08.860 --> 00:20:10.610
Wook, are you with me in Saejukwon?

00:20:11.320 --> 00:20:13.320
Let's go. Hurry

00:20:14.580 --> 00:20:16.540
- Be careful. Well!
- It hurts

00:20:16.620 --> 00:20:18.120
Look under your feet

00:20:23.250 --> 00:20:27.420
As you said, the owner lost all ten times

00:20:28.050 --> 00:20:29.840
You win, Your Highness

00:20:30.720 --> 00:20:34.390
Did you know he mastered Chisa?

00:20:35.970 --> 00:20:38.770
So I boldly put myself on the line

00:20:38.850 --> 00:20:41.060
If Cha Bum had not refused the fight,

00:20:41.730 --> 00:20:43.400
the owner would win

00:20:44.810 --> 00:20:46.480
He is no longer your master

00:20:48.360 --> 00:20:50.360
Now you serve Seo Yul

00:20:53.240 --> 00:20:56.030
You said that you share the same feelings

00:20:57.370 --> 00:20:58.450
Excellent

00:20:59.290 --> 00:21:01.960
I hope you don't lose them while you serve another

00:21:24.400 --> 00:21:25.770
This is funny

00:21:25.860 --> 00:21:28.150
How could he master Chisa so quickly?

00:21:28.230 --> 00:21:30.860
This is true. We've seen it all

00:21:31.490 --> 00:21:32.360
Really?

00:22:00.560 --> 00:22:02.270
Holy heavens!

00:22:03.560 --> 00:22:05.770
You really are a genius!

00:22:05.850 --> 00:22:07.400
That's it, Uk!

00:22:07.480 --> 00:22:09.650
- It hurts
- Sorry

00:22:10.690 --> 00:22:12.360
Master Huo, it hurts me

00:22:12.940 --> 00:22:15.200
You joined because you were worried

00:22:15.280 --> 00:22:17.410
that I will have to serve Cha Bum, right?

00:22:17.490 --> 00:22:19.830
Thank you for your kindness

00:22:19.910 --> 00:22:21.700
Now you serve me

00:22:22.750 --> 00:22:25.370
This is the promise I made to the prince

00:22:26.040 --> 00:22:27.670
And I have to pretend to follow it

00:22:27.750 --> 00:22:28.840
Of course

00:22:28.920 --> 00:22:32.420
If you need anything, speak at any time

00:22:32.510 --> 00:22:33.670
Nothing is needed

00:22:34.220 --> 00:22:36.340
You can visit Uka at any time

00:22:38.220 --> 00:22:39.390
I have

00:22:40.970 --> 00:22:42.600
just one request

00:22:44.270 --> 00:22:47.600
When I finish my studies I'll move back to Soho

00:22:48.560 --> 00:22:50.610
I want to take one person with me

00:22:51.520 --> 00:22:53.480
Please help me

00:22:54.900 --> 00:22:55.950
do it

00:22:57.780 --> 00:23:00.240
I didn't know you had such a person

00:23:00.320 --> 00:23:03.620
Give me your word. Promise you'll help

00:23:07.870 --> 00:23:10.420
You ask being my master

00:23:11.000 --> 00:23:13.050
I will definitely help you

00:23:24.140 --> 00:23:27.310
There's a soul-eater in Saejukwon right now

00:23:27.390 --> 00:23:29.150
And you brought Uka here

00:23:29.230 --> 00:23:31.560
What was left for me? He's wounded

00:23:32.150 --> 00:23:35.320
I told him to rest for a couple of days

00:23:36.610 --> 00:23:38.650
- Is he badly injured?
- No

00:23:38.740 --> 00:23:40.160
Nothing serious

00:23:41.490 --> 00:23:44.910
How could he fight Yul so recklessly?

00:23:44.990 --> 00:23:47.540
I would continue fishing with Master Li

00:23:47.620 --> 00:23:49.290
Shouldn't have called him back

00:23:50.210 --> 00:23:53.880
They must have done more than just fish

00:23:55.840 --> 00:23:59.050
Uk, such a bastard, he mastered Chisu

00:23:59.880 --> 00:24:00.890
What?

00:24:02.300 --> 00:24:03.760
Incredible, right?

00:24:03.850 --> 00:24:05.260
It's mind boggling

00:24:05.350 --> 00:24:07.220
He really is a genius!

00:24:15.110 --> 00:24:17.530
What did you study

00:24:18.360 --> 00:24:22.240
while I was fishing

00:24:22.320 --> 00:24:23.950
with Master Li?

00:24:25.620 --> 00:24:27.500
I learned to catch goldfish

00:24:27.580 --> 00:24:30.920
So he wanted to help you master Chisa

00:24:31.500 --> 00:24:34.590
- He took you as a student?
- Not really

00:24:34.670 --> 00:24:36.630
There's a reason he helps me

00:24:37.590 --> 00:24:39.970
Which one?

00:24:41.180 --> 00:24:43.970
Master to you

00:24:44.720 --> 00:24:45.890
something...

00:24:47.430 --> 00:24:48.720
did you tell?

00:24:50.640 --> 00:24:52.480
This concerns my family

00:24:52.560 --> 00:24:54.980
I noticed this myself and asked him directly

00:24:59.280 --> 00:25:02.450
It seems you know this too

00:25:04.990 --> 00:25:06.200
I was hoping

00:25:08.240 --> 00:25:09.790
that you won't recognize

00:25:10.710 --> 00:25:11.960
No

00:25:12.040 --> 00:25:15.250
I couldn't close my eyes to this when I found out everything

00:25:16.670 --> 00:25:18.170
So what will you do now?

00:25:22.720 --> 00:25:23.970
With maid Kim

00:25:32.480 --> 00:25:33.810
What does she have to do with it?

00:25:33.890 --> 00:25:36.560
Master Li is trying to woo maid Kim,

00:25:36.650 --> 00:25:38.610
helping me

00:25:39.940 --> 00:25:41.490
So what will you do?

00:25:42.700 --> 00:25:47.240
Master Li is a wonderful person who helped me a lot

00:25:48.870 --> 00:25:49.700
But still

00:25:50.700 --> 00:25:54.120
I thought I should give you a chance first

00:25:54.210 --> 00:25:55.790
If we take our relationship into account

00:25:59.550 --> 00:26:01.010
What's the chance?

00:26:02.130 --> 00:26:05.220
Do you know that Master Li lives with us?

00:26:06.340 --> 00:26:08.930
And I was wondering where he was staying

00:26:09.010 --> 00:26:11.220
So he lived in your house

00:26:11.310 --> 00:26:12.310
Yes

00:26:12.390 --> 00:26:15.560
I’m here now, and they’re probably drinking tea there and talking.

00:26:15.640 --> 00:26:17.730
Maid Kim is very kind

00:26:17.810 --> 00:26:20.320
She loves to care and feed others

00:26:20.400 --> 00:26:22.820
It's just a matter of time before she falls in love with him.

00:26:24.900 --> 00:26:26.610
I really hope

00:26:26.700 --> 00:26:29.530
that she will marry a good man

00:26:32.910 --> 00:26:34.540
If you don't mind,

00:26:35.370 --> 00:26:38.210
I would like to support them

00:26:51.850 --> 00:26:54.730
Master Li is twice her age

00:26:55.310 --> 00:26:58.560
But he looks younger than you

00:26:58.650 --> 00:27:00.190
It's still nonsense

00:27:00.270 --> 00:27:03.480
He practices chastity

00:27:04.360 --> 00:27:06.110
How can they get married?

00:27:06.700 --> 00:27:10.240
I suppressed my instincts for the sake of training, but then quickly recovered

00:27:10.320 --> 00:27:11.870
It's possible

00:27:11.950 --> 00:27:13.990
Marriage must be by mutual consent

00:27:15.250 --> 00:27:17.210
She must want it too

00:27:17.290 --> 00:27:18.960
All these years she

00:27:19.960 --> 00:27:23.750
loves one person

00:27:25.210 --> 00:27:26.380
Jin

00:27:26.470 --> 00:27:32.430
Do you really think she still loves Chang Gang?

00:27:34.350 --> 00:27:36.730
I know her best

00:27:37.310 --> 00:27:40.270
Therefore, I ask you, do not make hasty conclusions

00:27:42.310 --> 00:27:44.730
What should I do with you?

00:27:44.820 --> 00:27:46.860
And he calls someone else stupid,

00:27:46.940 --> 00:27:49.410
when he doesn’t see anything under his nose

00:27:49.490 --> 00:27:50.870
What do you know?

00:27:51.450 --> 00:27:54.290
She stopped loving Chang Gang a long time ago

00:28:18.980 --> 00:28:20.230
On that day

00:28:21.850 --> 00:28:23.150
he was here too

00:28:27.990 --> 00:28:30.070
This is freshly brewed quince tea

00:28:30.150 --> 00:28:31.240
What a pleasant aroma

00:28:32.870 --> 00:28:35.740
It's not good to keep wilted flowers in the house.

00:28:35.830 --> 00:28:38.080
The cold weather has arrived, now flowers are hard to find

00:28:38.790 --> 00:28:40.710
But I'll listen to you and throw them away

00:28:42.040 --> 00:28:43.710
I liked the way flowers

00:28:43.790 --> 00:28:45.670
kept me company

00:28:59.980 --> 00:29:03.020
I completely forgot about the cups and only brought a teapot

00:29:09.610 --> 00:29:11.610
How could they bloom again?

00:29:12.780 --> 00:29:14.570
Master Li did this?

00:29:16.530 --> 00:29:17.370
What a beauty

00:29:34.760 --> 00:29:36.010
It must be

00:29:36.970 --> 00:29:39.220
he gave her flowers

00:29:40.850 --> 00:29:42.430
that day

00:29:51.070 --> 00:29:53.570
Master Li, you are very kind and sympathetic

00:29:54.450 --> 00:29:55.610
Me?

00:29:56.280 --> 00:29:58.780
Stay here as long as you want

00:29:58.870 --> 00:30:00.620
I'll take care of you

00:30:02.330 --> 00:30:03.410
Thank you

00:30:06.630 --> 00:30:09.130
Is this girl Chang Gang's wife?

00:30:11.460 --> 00:30:14.630
Yes, beautiful, right?

00:30:14.720 --> 00:30:18.390
Was it Jin who was head over heels in love with her? Yeom told

00:30:21.970 --> 00:30:27.020
She did not wither and kept her beauty intact

00:30:28.810 --> 00:30:31.530
Maybe that's why he still can't forget her

00:30:32.940 --> 00:30:34.280
Or

00:30:35.110 --> 00:30:36.660
he just doesn't like me

00:30:37.490 --> 00:30:38.700
I don't know

00:30:44.830 --> 00:30:46.920
I understand, that’s what the prince ordered

00:30:47.000 --> 00:30:49.250
But how could he forbid Moo Deok from visiting me?

00:30:49.340 --> 00:30:51.170
She was worried all over

00:30:51.250 --> 00:30:53.840
I'm sure she's just busy

00:30:53.920 --> 00:30:55.720
I told her you're fine

00:30:55.800 --> 00:30:56.720
Well no

00:30:56.800 --> 00:30:59.220
Do you think she immediately relaxed after your words?

00:30:59.850 --> 00:31:00.930
We need to check

00:31:02.100 --> 00:31:03.020
Come here

00:31:06.060 --> 00:31:07.980
It will only cause you pain

00:31:09.690 --> 00:31:13.980
This bird delivers my letters to Soho

00:31:16.950 --> 00:31:20.910
It takes three to four days to get there on horseback.

00:31:20.990 --> 00:31:22.660
Can a bird fly this distance?

00:31:23.240 --> 00:31:24.370
Incredible

00:31:37.340 --> 00:31:38.970
Do you have a whistle?

00:31:40.050 --> 00:31:42.680
Sorry, I don't carry it with me

00:31:45.890 --> 00:31:48.350
This is a gift from your loved one

00:31:48.440 --> 00:31:49.270
I'm hurt

00:31:59.910 --> 00:32:02.830
You need to blow twice for the bird to come back

00:32:04.120 --> 00:32:05.540
You did well

00:32:06.120 --> 00:32:07.330
Try it

00:32:37.030 --> 00:32:38.190
Look

00:32:41.320 --> 00:32:42.820
The bird is back

00:32:45.160 --> 00:32:46.740
Now blow twice quickly

00:33:09.640 --> 00:33:12.440
I said that to calm him down

00:33:12.520 --> 00:33:15.230
He was worried that his tame bird had a hard time in the winter,

00:33:16.150 --> 00:33:17.770
that's why I lied

00:33:20.320 --> 00:33:23.030
Do you see? Moo Deok is doing well

00:33:27.030 --> 00:33:29.080
Wait, wait, Uk

00:33:29.160 --> 00:33:32.370
What exactly did Moo Deok bet on with the Crown Prince?

00:33:32.460 --> 00:33:33.830
The thing you wanted back

00:33:36.790 --> 00:33:39.170
It doesn't matter. Now I can't get her back since I lost

00:33:45.680 --> 00:33:49.640
But why is she so carefree when she lost him?

00:33:57.940 --> 00:34:00.150
- So what was it?
- Don't ask

00:34:00.730 --> 00:34:04.360
Why haven't you ever visited Wook in Saejukwon?

00:34:05.780 --> 00:34:08.530
I'm your new owner, but don't worry about it

00:34:09.370 --> 00:34:11.160
That's not the point

00:34:11.660 --> 00:34:13.660
I'm just trying not to be shameless

00:34:25.340 --> 00:34:27.720
So you don't care if you lose him or not?

00:34:31.310 --> 00:34:34.810
I have to find him. I must find him today

00:34:36.100 --> 00:34:38.940
Only then will I be able to look him in the eyes

00:34:50.950 --> 00:34:52.290
I knew it

00:34:55.500 --> 00:34:57.000
He drinks that tea

00:34:58.960 --> 00:35:00.920
He disgraced the magicians and ran away

00:35:01.000 --> 00:35:04.800
And then he improved and defeated the Crown Prince. This is weird

00:35:04.880 --> 00:35:07.260
He decided to become Master Li's student

00:35:07.340 --> 00:35:09.090
and practice chastity

00:35:09.180 --> 00:35:10.600
Have you all seen Master Li?

00:35:11.180 --> 00:35:12.600
He was a student of Master Seo Kyung,

00:35:12.680 --> 00:35:14.470
and Master Ho Yeom is his student

00:35:14.560 --> 00:35:16.690
But he looks younger than our leader

00:35:16.770 --> 00:35:19.190
And all because he practices chastity

00:35:19.270 --> 00:35:23.110
Heard that he doesn't age because he reached the highest level when he was young

00:35:23.190 --> 00:35:26.240
How's that? I heard he became younger thanks to a spell

00:35:26.320 --> 00:35:27.200
A spell?

00:35:27.280 --> 00:35:30.200
That's not important. Uk is determined

00:35:30.280 --> 00:35:31.740
So what if he reached Chisu?

00:35:32.330 --> 00:35:33.660
I'm in his place

00:35:35.790 --> 00:35:37.540
wouldn't refrain

00:35:38.250 --> 00:35:39.830
Of course me too

00:35:39.920 --> 00:35:41.750
- He's really stubborn
- Don't tell me

00:35:45.300 --> 00:35:46.670
They're just all jealous

00:35:48.470 --> 00:35:51.800
There are so many terrible rumors about Mr. Chan Wook

00:35:59.690 --> 00:36:00.940
I was able

00:36:01.730 --> 00:36:05.150
get some sleep thanks to her meds

00:36:07.820 --> 00:36:10.950
I'm glad that the medicinal herbs were beneficial

00:36:11.990 --> 00:36:15.490
I used valerian root, which grows in the swamps of the Vol fortress

00:36:15.580 --> 00:36:17.370
It is known for its calming effect.

00:36:17.450 --> 00:36:21.250
It should help you relax and improve your sleep

00:36:21.790 --> 00:36:24.250
I understand why Master Ho Yeom recommended you

00:36:25.710 --> 00:36:28.170
Luckily, I can now get some sleep

00:36:28.260 --> 00:36:31.550
But the tinnitus and headache still remain

00:36:31.640 --> 00:36:34.010
The news about the nomads has gotten worse

00:36:34.100 --> 00:36:35.890
your condition

00:36:35.970 --> 00:36:38.520
A nomad tried to break into the palace

00:36:38.600 --> 00:36:41.440
There might be some inside too.

00:36:42.020 --> 00:36:43.440
Gwangju Deputy Jin Moo

00:36:43.520 --> 00:36:45.520
I've beefed up security, so don't worry

00:36:45.610 --> 00:36:48.240
It was his man trying to get here!

00:36:48.990 --> 00:36:50.110
Yes, there are rumors

00:36:50.200 --> 00:36:53.160
that another nomad was seen in Jeonbugwan

00:36:54.990 --> 00:36:56.740
I can't trust anyone

00:36:59.620 --> 00:37:03.000
Your anxiety seems to come from the heart, Your Majesty

00:37:03.080 --> 00:37:06.590
Maybe we can find another way to calm you down?

00:37:07.670 --> 00:37:11.130
Do you know Hemp Master Li?

00:37:11.220 --> 00:37:13.260
Master Seo Kyung's last student

00:37:13.840 --> 00:37:15.930
I heard about him

00:37:16.010 --> 00:37:17.970
but I saw it only once in Sosnovy Bor

00:37:18.770 --> 00:37:22.980
My grandfather was his student, so I heard a lot about him

00:37:23.060 --> 00:37:27.020
Perhaps it can ease your anxiety

00:37:27.980 --> 00:37:29.820
Are you saying that he can determine

00:37:29.900 --> 00:37:31.990
Are there any nomads around me?

00:37:32.070 --> 00:37:34.610
I don't know him personally, so I don't know

00:37:34.700 --> 00:37:38.330
I think you can invite him to the palace and ask for help

00:37:44.750 --> 00:37:46.590
I told you to clean here every day!

00:37:46.670 --> 00:37:49.210
The water in the vase has spoiled!

00:37:50.510 --> 00:37:51.470
Sorry

00:37:52.380 --> 00:37:54.010
What if Boo Young came back?

00:37:54.090 --> 00:37:56.140
and saw a vase with stagnant water here?

00:37:56.220 --> 00:37:57.890
She would be disappointed in me

00:37:58.930 --> 00:38:00.560
Change the sheets

00:38:00.640 --> 00:38:02.020
and get rid of it

00:38:02.100 --> 00:38:04.060
She's blind, so why did you put this here?

00:38:04.140 --> 00:38:05.810
To make her trip?

00:38:18.700 --> 00:38:20.950
Dozens of girls have already come to us,

00:38:22.120 --> 00:38:23.620
but Boo Young was not among them

00:38:24.160 --> 00:38:28.380
She's upset about it and has become very sensitive.

00:38:28.460 --> 00:38:29.800
I noticed this too

00:38:30.710 --> 00:38:33.550
But your birthday is coming soon

00:38:36.550 --> 00:38:39.550
- Here
- What is this?

00:38:42.560 --> 00:38:45.140
Dad, they are so beautiful

00:38:46.690 --> 00:38:48.770
But my birthday is not today

00:38:48.860 --> 00:38:51.480
On this day I will give something more beautiful

00:38:53.070 --> 00:38:55.450
I want to try them on. Can you help me?

00:38:56.950 --> 00:38:58.030
Of course

00:39:02.370 --> 00:39:06.250
Let's see how beautiful my daughter is

00:39:06.920 --> 00:39:10.630
When I was little you always braided my hair

00:39:15.260 --> 00:39:19.050
Mother never did this

00:39:21.510 --> 00:39:23.430
Sorry. Is it very painful?

00:39:24.520 --> 00:39:25.640
It's okay

00:39:40.160 --> 00:39:43.740
I've probably forgotten how to braid my hair, I haven't done it for a long time

00:39:43.830 --> 00:39:44.830
Sorry

00:39:44.910 --> 00:39:48.000
Everything is fine. What do I look like?

00:39:48.620 --> 00:39:50.250
You are always beautiful

00:40:23.780 --> 00:40:25.830
Park Jin shot me with this bow

00:40:28.580 --> 00:40:30.080
I lost that day

00:40:30.170 --> 00:40:33.540
I can't come up with excuses or not accept the outcome of the battle

00:40:36.090 --> 00:40:38.050
But when I get my power back,

00:40:39.010 --> 00:40:42.010
I would like to fight him for real

00:40:53.980 --> 00:40:55.070
What are you doing?

00:40:56.650 --> 00:40:58.530
I'm getting out, head

00:41:00.570 --> 00:41:02.110
Don't touch everything

00:41:02.700 --> 00:41:05.870
A weapon containing the energy of a strong magician,

00:41:05.950 --> 00:41:08.750
dangerous for a fragile girl

00:41:10.370 --> 00:41:12.580
Even I know this

00:41:13.170 --> 00:41:16.380
But why did you put it here?

00:41:16.460 --> 00:41:19.050
I have to clean up here

00:41:19.130 --> 00:41:21.880
I usually hang it on the wall

00:41:22.970 --> 00:41:24.140
I forgot this time

00:41:24.220 --> 00:41:25.930
But you are still so young

00:41:26.010 --> 00:41:29.600
I can't believe you're already so forgetful

00:41:30.310 --> 00:41:33.560
I'm just worried, like a servant of Sosnovy Bor

00:41:33.650 --> 00:41:36.650
What if you forget to pay me?

00:41:37.440 --> 00:41:38.530
Chapter

00:41:38.610 --> 00:41:42.110
Please, be healthy. You are still so young

00:41:45.410 --> 00:41:48.410
I'll be back later to finish cleaning up.

00:41:54.420 --> 00:41:56.580
How smart

00:41:57.380 --> 00:41:59.000
but a cheeky girl

00:41:59.710 --> 00:42:01.260
Like Moo Deok

00:42:01.340 --> 00:42:04.340
met Uk?

00:42:04.430 --> 00:42:05.930
I don't know the details

00:42:06.010 --> 00:42:09.850
But I heard that he paid her debts and took her from Chwisongru

00:42:09.930 --> 00:42:12.060
Then go to Chwiseonra

00:42:12.140 --> 00:42:14.770
and ask about her

00:42:15.480 --> 00:42:19.020
Find out about her past and her character

00:42:20.110 --> 00:42:21.940
I'm just wondering

00:42:25.490 --> 00:42:27.370
I don't really know either

00:42:27.450 --> 00:42:30.490
But the merchant who brought her is now in the capital

00:42:30.580 --> 00:42:33.200
I'll tell him to come to Sosnovy Bor

00:42:35.830 --> 00:42:38.040
Hey there

00:42:40.500 --> 00:42:42.210
We've already met in the village of Sari, haven't we?

00:42:42.800 --> 00:42:44.510
What do you need this time?

00:42:44.590 --> 00:42:45.760
So I

00:42:45.840 --> 00:42:47.800
Have you met her in the capital?

00:42:48.300 --> 00:42:50.600
Do you know where she might be?

00:42:50.680 --> 00:42:53.770
Don't know. She is not a resident of Sari

00:42:54.350 --> 00:42:57.600
She was there for a couple of months and then she robbed the villagers

00:42:57.690 --> 00:42:59.060
Let me know if you catch her

00:43:04.070 --> 00:43:06.490
Where can I find it?

00:43:10.410 --> 00:43:11.450
That's it

00:43:12.200 --> 00:43:14.580
So Yi, you've made some bad friends.

00:43:16.080 --> 00:43:19.130
Maybe she went looking for Moo Deok?

00:43:22.630 --> 00:43:25.220
Soon I will take you to Jinyeowon

00:43:25.300 --> 00:43:27.880
But first we need to take care of something

00:43:37.810 --> 00:43:40.270
Here, eat

00:43:40.360 --> 00:43:42.520
You stole my money

00:43:42.610 --> 00:43:43.860
Give me back my ring

00:43:49.570 --> 00:43:52.370
Did you meet them in the capital?

00:43:52.450 --> 00:43:55.500
Yes, but why did you bring them here?

00:43:55.580 --> 00:43:58.370
I like that you are smart and persistent

00:43:58.920 --> 00:44:00.830
But it also makes you dangerous

00:44:01.920 --> 00:44:03.920
I want you to see something

00:44:20.730 --> 00:44:21.940
Gwangju Deputy

00:44:22.480 --> 00:44:25.280
Thank you for feeding me

00:45:27.000 --> 00:45:28.460
Be afraid

00:45:28.550 --> 00:45:32.470
Betray me or reveal your identity and you will suffer the same fate.

00:45:38.390 --> 00:45:39.390
Okay

00:45:40.350 --> 00:45:42.980
Tell me is there anyone else who might recognize you

00:45:43.480 --> 00:45:44.810
I have to get rid of them

00:45:46.310 --> 00:45:47.690
Is there?

00:45:51.650 --> 00:45:52.820
Yes

00:45:56.200 --> 00:45:59.790
Search more carefully. I definitely threw it there

00:45:59.870 --> 00:46:01.250
I don't see anything

00:46:01.830 --> 00:46:04.120
Look there

00:46:04.210 --> 00:46:06.960
I took a good look, there's nothing there

00:46:07.040 --> 00:46:08.750
Look again

00:46:08.840 --> 00:46:10.210
I can barely see...

00:46:11.380 --> 00:46:12.590
Yes, Your Highness

00:46:13.130 --> 00:46:15.090
I'm sure he's here somewhere

00:46:15.180 --> 00:46:16.840
Yes, look there

00:46:21.430 --> 00:46:22.770
What are you doing?

00:46:24.980 --> 00:46:26.270
It's none of your business. Go away

00:46:27.440 --> 00:46:30.980
I'm afraid eunuch O is suffering in vain

00:46:31.070 --> 00:46:34.650
I have to say something. Can?

00:46:34.740 --> 00:46:36.280
What do you have?

00:46:37.700 --> 00:46:38.660
Maybe,

00:46:39.700 --> 00:46:40.790
you are looking for

00:46:41.580 --> 00:46:43.120
this?

00:46:44.710 --> 00:46:45.710
Did you find him?

00:46:45.790 --> 00:46:49.210
I searched day and night, I found it not long ago

00:46:53.840 --> 00:46:55.260
You threw it away

00:46:55.930 --> 00:46:58.510
And I picked it up, which means it’s mine again

00:47:02.890 --> 00:47:05.270
Eunuch Oh, you can come out of there

00:47:06.600 --> 00:47:07.900
Yes

00:47:11.070 --> 00:47:14.320
Thanks to you I gained something valuable

00:47:14.900 --> 00:47:18.070
I have it again thanks to you

00:47:19.660 --> 00:47:20.700
Exactly

00:47:20.780 --> 00:47:24.750
I didn't break it, I didn't throw it far

00:47:24.830 --> 00:47:27.330
You found it because I threw it close

00:47:27.420 --> 00:47:32.920
I dare to try to understand you, Your Highness

00:47:33.000 --> 00:47:36.130
You make excuses and get angry because

00:47:36.220 --> 00:47:38.260
what are you sorry for?

00:47:38.890 --> 00:47:41.850
Won Moo Deok should only listen without trying to understand

00:47:41.930 --> 00:47:43.720
How dare you even try?

00:47:43.810 --> 00:47:45.770
Sorry, Your Highness

00:47:49.060 --> 00:47:50.150
Your Highness

00:47:53.940 --> 00:47:55.070
Your Highness

00:47:55.150 --> 00:47:58.820
Master Ho asked me to tell you that Master Li has arrived

00:47:58.910 --> 00:48:01.070
Okay. Is he in Saejukwon?

00:48:01.160 --> 00:48:04.620
Yes. His student Chang Wook is with him

00:48:06.410 --> 00:48:08.830
They say Chan Wook has achieved such success

00:48:08.920 --> 00:48:10.830
thanks to Master Li's instructions

00:48:10.920 --> 00:48:12.670
If not for this,

00:48:12.750 --> 00:48:14.880
he wouldn't beat you

00:48:17.880 --> 00:48:18.840
Let's go

00:48:30.940 --> 00:48:33.440
You serve Seo Yul now, not Chan Wook

00:48:34.070 --> 00:48:36.480
If I had defeated Chang Wook,

00:48:36.570 --> 00:48:38.280
would you serve me

00:48:38.360 --> 00:48:40.150
If you hadn't refused the fight,

00:48:40.860 --> 00:48:43.870
you wouldn't have to wait on me

00:48:43.950 --> 00:48:46.660
I would let him win out of pity

00:48:47.250 --> 00:48:48.660
Don't you feel sorry for him?

00:48:48.750 --> 00:48:50.410
Everyone in Sosnovy Bor knows

00:48:50.500 --> 00:48:52.750
that Chan Wook practices chastity

00:48:53.330 --> 00:48:55.170
- Is that so?
- Don't pretend you don't know

00:48:55.250 --> 00:48:56.550
You know best

00:48:57.130 --> 00:48:59.170
You weren't the one who brought it to him

00:48:59.760 --> 00:49:01.180
Chastity tea?

00:49:01.260 --> 00:49:02.430
I've never done this

00:49:02.510 --> 00:49:05.600
How else could he master Chisa so quickly?

00:49:06.970 --> 00:49:08.980
He's not even Chang Gang's son

00:49:10.310 --> 00:49:14.020
His mother married Chang Gan and gave birth to a son

00:49:14.730 --> 00:49:17.360
And now her son will inherit everything

00:49:18.690 --> 00:49:22.490
His father closed his gates to end the Uka line

00:49:22.570 --> 00:49:25.530
But Chan Wook opened them, he should be chaste

00:49:26.450 --> 00:49:27.540
Exactly

00:49:28.830 --> 00:49:32.040
Mean and nasty

00:49:32.620 --> 00:49:33.460
What?

00:49:35.000 --> 00:49:36.250
What did you say?

00:49:37.500 --> 00:49:40.170
- You heard
- How dare you?

00:49:40.670 --> 00:49:43.220
- Repeat
- Then you will hit me

00:49:43.300 --> 00:49:44.550
Then tell me!

00:49:46.930 --> 00:49:48.180
Tell them

00:49:58.480 --> 00:49:59.690
If they should hear

00:49:59.780 --> 00:50:03.570
say it loud and clear

00:50:09.370 --> 00:50:12.460
You are mean and nasty

00:50:14.500 --> 00:50:17.040
That's what she said. Got it?

00:50:17.670 --> 00:50:18.500
Yes

00:50:19.590 --> 00:50:22.340
Moo Deok, I gave you something

00:50:22.420 --> 00:50:23.590
Show them

00:50:30.470 --> 00:50:32.230
This sachet is my gift

00:50:32.310 --> 00:50:36.440
If someone beats, scolds or insults you when I'm not around,

00:50:36.520 --> 00:50:38.310
just tell me

00:50:39.570 --> 00:50:40.520
Yes

00:50:42.610 --> 00:50:43.860
You can go

00:50:53.080 --> 00:50:55.620
It's stupid to make an enemy

00:50:55.710 --> 00:50:59.290
out of envy that someone is stronger

00:51:08.720 --> 00:51:10.390
There's ink on your clothes

00:51:11.060 --> 00:51:13.770
They can be raised with white rice

00:51:15.020 --> 00:51:17.100
These are two completely different colors

00:51:17.940 --> 00:51:20.560
But together they can remove the stain

00:51:21.190 --> 00:51:22.690
Wise words

00:51:23.440 --> 00:51:25.860
Where did you read them, Your Highness?

00:51:27.320 --> 00:51:28.740
Somewhere

00:51:28.820 --> 00:51:31.080
This is only asked in the most difficult exams.

00:51:45.550 --> 00:51:47.430
My master isn't here?

00:51:50.850 --> 00:51:53.720
I heard you were wounded. Are you okay?

00:51:54.310 --> 00:51:57.270
Yes, thanks to you. Thanks for those medicines

00:51:59.270 --> 00:52:03.360
Maid Kim invited me to dinner

00:52:04.690 --> 00:52:07.780
Maybe you'll join us?

00:52:08.740 --> 00:52:09.660
Of course

00:52:11.780 --> 00:52:14.700
Then I will choose a day and tell Moo Deok

00:52:15.580 --> 00:52:17.080
Do you know my maid?

00:52:17.160 --> 00:52:20.210
I once came to see you,

00:52:20.290 --> 00:52:21.920
but it didn't work out for me

00:52:22.710 --> 00:52:25.250
She came into your room then

00:52:30.970 --> 00:52:32.140
Don't go

00:52:33.350 --> 00:52:35.140
Don't go to your place, stay here

00:52:36.100 --> 00:52:37.890
I'll bring your clothes

00:52:39.980 --> 00:52:41.020
What was that?

00:52:41.900 --> 00:52:43.230
A step forward?

00:52:43.770 --> 00:52:45.320
What are you talking about?

00:52:47.230 --> 00:52:48.360
Yes so

00:52:55.490 --> 00:52:56.490
Just a second

00:52:57.750 --> 00:52:59.790
Calm down

00:53:00.750 --> 00:53:01.920
Flew away

00:53:02.710 --> 00:53:04.090
- Really?
- Yes

00:53:06.210 --> 00:53:08.130
I was so scared

00:53:21.190 --> 00:53:22.310
Moo Deok...

00:53:38.620 --> 00:53:40.960
Moo Deok, we meet again

00:53:44.380 --> 00:53:46.250
Take care of yourself

00:53:46.340 --> 00:53:47.670
See you at the palace

00:53:47.750 --> 00:53:49.090
Yes

00:54:02.640 --> 00:54:04.270
What is it? Did you run here?

00:54:05.190 --> 00:54:06.110
Yes

00:54:06.190 --> 00:54:08.860
It's been a long time since you visited me when I was wounded.

00:54:08.940 --> 00:54:09.780
What's the matter?

00:54:09.860 --> 00:54:12.150
Something more serious than a change of owner?

00:54:12.240 --> 00:54:13.200
No

00:54:13.280 --> 00:54:15.240
Other magicians were gossiping about you

00:54:15.320 --> 00:54:16.490
I wanted to know the truth

00:54:16.570 --> 00:54:18.910
I see. Have you heard about that tea?

00:54:18.990 --> 00:54:20.740
But you know the truth

00:54:20.830 --> 00:54:24.120
Well, what if? You caught the Golden Fish while I was away

00:54:24.870 --> 00:54:27.040
Maybe you really became Master Li's disciple?

00:54:27.130 --> 00:54:29.250
What? No, of course

00:54:29.340 --> 00:54:30.380
Forget it

00:54:30.460 --> 00:54:32.470
I offered it to you myself

00:54:33.260 --> 00:54:34.880
I guess I couldn't resist

00:54:34.970 --> 00:54:36.840
How can I prove it to you?

00:54:38.010 --> 00:54:39.350
You said it yourself

00:54:49.150 --> 00:54:50.150
Do you see?

00:54:52.650 --> 00:54:54.070
You don't see a woman in me

00:54:54.150 --> 00:54:57.200
I should have hugged that sweet girl as proof

00:54:58.570 --> 00:55:00.620
Should I really hug her?

00:55:01.830 --> 00:55:03.870
Yes. Come on

00:55:03.950 --> 00:55:05.620
Don't change your mind later

00:55:05.710 --> 00:55:07.080
Okay, go!

00:55:42.330 --> 00:55:43.990
You said we need to attack

00:55:44.080 --> 00:55:46.460
when the enemy least expects it

00:55:47.620 --> 00:55:51.000
I followed your advice, teacher

00:55:53.800 --> 00:55:56.590
Yes. Well done. I'm proud of you

00:55:58.840 --> 00:56:00.010
By the way, teacher,

00:56:00.640 --> 00:56:04.310
I heard you ran into her in my room

00:56:06.480 --> 00:56:07.560
So what?

00:56:07.640 --> 00:56:09.350
Is that why you stopped me then?

00:56:13.150 --> 00:56:14.690
Did that actually happen?

00:56:15.530 --> 00:56:17.030
I don't remember

00:56:17.740 --> 00:56:19.820
Understanding you is more difficult than controlling you

00:56:19.910 --> 00:56:21.280
energy of Gyeongjeongdaeho

00:56:22.740 --> 00:56:24.490
You stopped me

00:56:27.000 --> 00:56:29.500
Master, I'm going to the palace today

00:56:29.580 --> 00:56:31.460
The king invited Master Li,

00:56:32.080 --> 00:56:34.170
and I'll keep him company

00:56:34.250 --> 00:56:36.880
I wanted to see the queen, and now I got the chance

00:56:37.630 --> 00:56:39.170
Be careful

00:56:40.470 --> 00:56:43.300
I will. I'll tell you everything when I get back

00:56:51.270 --> 00:56:52.310
Chan Wook

00:56:56.610 --> 00:56:57.900
I found him

00:56:59.650 --> 00:57:03.660
It happened that way, so I thought I should tell you

00:57:05.910 --> 00:57:06.910
Go

00:57:26.260 --> 00:57:28.600
Why is the head of Sosnovy Bor looking for me?

00:57:29.640 --> 00:57:31.730
- Do you remember Moo Deok?
- Yes

00:57:31.810 --> 00:57:34.810
He wants to know more about her life in Sari

00:57:34.900 --> 00:57:38.150
He can ask her himself

00:57:38.230 --> 00:57:39.190
She's here

00:57:39.280 --> 00:57:41.740
No. She is in Sosnovy Bor

00:57:41.820 --> 00:57:42.950
Yes?

00:57:43.740 --> 00:57:46.580
What is the blind woman doing there?

00:57:48.870 --> 00:57:51.410
Master Lee wants you two and Chan Wook

00:57:51.500 --> 00:57:53.330
escorted him to the palace

00:57:54.500 --> 00:57:55.830
Will Uk come too?

00:57:57.340 --> 00:57:58.460
Is he feeling better now?

00:57:58.550 --> 00:58:00.420
We're leaving soon. Get ready

00:58:08.720 --> 00:58:11.390
Be careful in the palace

00:58:11.480 --> 00:58:13.850
There's an ice stone

00:58:15.520 --> 00:58:17.110
I know it myself

00:58:17.190 --> 00:58:20.360
Since they shamelessly hide it,

00:58:20.440 --> 00:58:23.400
I decided to make a bold move

00:58:28.990 --> 00:58:31.580
When was the last time I was invited to the palace,

00:58:32.160 --> 00:58:34.580
you were very small

00:58:35.120 --> 00:58:38.130
I remember how much I liked sweets,

00:58:38.210 --> 00:58:40.500
which you then brought

00:58:40.590 --> 00:58:41.760
By the way,

00:58:42.340 --> 00:58:45.970
and the king will not need to present a gift?

00:58:46.050 --> 00:58:48.010
I have already prepared one

00:58:48.100 --> 00:58:48.970
Yeom

00:58:49.050 --> 00:58:51.890
Send the gift to the palace at the appointed time

00:58:51.970 --> 00:58:53.520
Yes, teacher

00:58:53.600 --> 00:58:55.190
Somewhere between 5 and 7 pm?

00:58:55.270 --> 00:58:56.690
Between 7 and 9, idiot!

00:58:57.270 --> 00:58:59.020
Exactly. Sorry

00:58:59.730 --> 00:59:01.730
Write it down if you can't remember

00:59:02.650 --> 00:59:04.150
You were absent-minded before

00:59:04.240 --> 00:59:07.160
and with age everything became even worse

00:59:09.450 --> 00:59:10.580
Forward

00:59:11.080 --> 00:59:12.750
Goodbye

00:59:13.950 --> 00:59:16.620
I'll never get used to this, guys.

00:59:45.240 --> 00:59:46.360
Moo Deok

00:59:47.990 --> 00:59:49.870
The boss wants to see you

00:59:51.330 --> 00:59:52.530
Chapter?

01:00:01.420 --> 01:00:02.420
Moo Deok

01:00:15.640 --> 01:00:20.150
Everything about you came out

01:00:21.110 --> 01:00:24.690
I told him about your eyes

01:00:29.280 --> 01:00:30.820
Will everything open up now?

01:00:32.450 --> 01:00:35.120
Head, you see...

01:00:36.700 --> 01:00:39.120
She wasn't the only one lying

01:00:40.460 --> 01:00:44.130
Her grandma begged me so I played along

01:00:44.920 --> 01:00:48.300
Her family was very poor

01:00:48.380 --> 01:00:50.300
She lied that she was blind

01:00:50.880 --> 01:00:53.350
so that it is not sold to pay off debts

01:00:53.430 --> 01:00:55.640
Like those who pretend to be lame,

01:00:55.720 --> 01:00:57.680
so as not to go to war

01:00:57.770 --> 01:01:01.560
Why did you lie when you got to Jwiseonra?

01:01:04.110 --> 01:01:06.610
She wanted to run away

01:01:07.280 --> 01:01:09.110
Of course it was sold

01:01:09.190 --> 01:01:12.660
But being blind it would be easier to escape

01:01:13.280 --> 01:01:15.620
- Am I right?
- Yes

01:01:15.700 --> 01:01:18.660
I tried to escape when I met the owner

01:01:19.370 --> 01:01:22.040
He took pity on me and took me in

01:01:24.920 --> 01:01:27.090
Sorry for lying, head

01:01:28.300 --> 01:01:29.550
I did wrong

01:01:30.880 --> 01:01:32.340
Besides this lie

01:01:32.430 --> 01:01:34.260
she has no other sins

01:01:34.340 --> 01:01:38.060
She was always a good granddaughter and a kind girl

01:01:49.820 --> 01:01:51.990
Why did you lie?

01:01:53.070 --> 01:01:56.030
Just earning my money

01:01:56.620 --> 01:01:57.910
Did you earn the money?

01:02:00.660 --> 01:02:03.000
Aren't you blind?

01:02:06.210 --> 01:02:07.090
Well yes

01:02:07.170 --> 01:02:10.630
It always seemed strange to me

01:02:11.630 --> 01:02:13.760
- What?
- Even being blind,

01:02:13.840 --> 01:02:16.090
you always knew who was standing in front of you

01:02:16.180 --> 01:02:18.220
I knew if it would rain or snow

01:02:18.810 --> 01:02:23.310
The villagers thought you were lying about being blind.

01:02:23.390 --> 01:02:26.310
They were afraid and avoided you

01:02:27.480 --> 01:02:29.150
- I see
- In general,

01:02:29.230 --> 01:02:31.690
If you need help, come to the inn

01:02:31.780 --> 01:02:32.820
Fine?

01:02:33.570 --> 01:02:34.490
By the way

01:02:35.030 --> 01:02:37.320
Have you met So Yi yet?

01:02:38.410 --> 01:02:39.580
So Yi?

01:02:39.660 --> 01:02:41.660
She's in the capital now

01:02:41.750 --> 01:02:43.540
Some bandits were looking for her

01:02:43.620 --> 01:02:46.040
What did she do this time?

01:02:46.120 --> 01:02:49.420
She robbed your house after your grandmother died

01:02:50.250 --> 01:02:52.380
Don't mess with her

01:02:52.460 --> 01:02:55.050
It seems you are hiding something from Sosnovy Bor

01:02:56.430 --> 01:02:59.640
You said that you worked off the money. Who paid you?

01:02:59.720 --> 01:03:00.810
Joo Wol

01:03:05.730 --> 01:03:07.230
Don't thank me

01:03:07.730 --> 01:03:09.770
It was Mr. Chan's money

01:03:14.240 --> 01:03:19.120
If anyone asks about Moo Deok,

01:03:19.200 --> 01:03:20.330
use this money

01:03:21.490 --> 01:03:24.080
Of course, half is yours

01:03:24.750 --> 01:03:27.670
I didn't hide anything vile

01:03:27.750 --> 01:03:29.670
Got my share

01:03:30.750 --> 01:03:32.550
Yes and I like you

01:03:33.550 --> 01:03:35.220
I'm really grateful

01:03:35.300 --> 01:03:38.010
What's really wrong with your eyes?

01:03:43.060 --> 01:03:44.180
Forget it

01:03:44.270 --> 01:03:45.980
There are certainly reasons

01:03:50.520 --> 01:03:54.860
If Chang Wook hadn't prepared in advance, Park Jin would have found out everything

01:03:55.490 --> 01:03:59.760
If they catch me, Chan Wook will also suffer

01:04:13.340 --> 01:04:15.260
Welcome Master Lee Chul

01:04:16.170 --> 01:04:18.470
Thank you for the invitation, Your Majesty

01:04:20.720 --> 01:04:22.640
This shaman Choi

01:04:23.220 --> 01:04:25.180
told you to kill me?

01:04:28.440 --> 01:04:30.650
Shaman Choi

01:04:30.730 --> 01:04:32.480
Is this the queen?

01:04:38.780 --> 01:04:39.820
Moo Deok

01:04:43.280 --> 01:04:45.080
So Yi you mentioned

01:04:45.700 --> 01:04:48.330
Maybe this is the girl who was looking for you recently

01:04:49.580 --> 01:04:51.710
I heard she's dangerous. Be careful

01:04:55.130 --> 01:04:58.050
I don't recognize her because I don't know her

01:04:58.590 --> 01:05:00.840
Should I ask that guy about her?

01:05:01.390 --> 01:05:04.100
If you need help, come to the inn

01:05:05.220 --> 01:05:06.770
Inn...

01:05:13.360 --> 01:05:17.150
Everything about you came out

01:05:36.170 --> 01:05:38.550
Trader Kim from Sari Village is here?

01:05:38.630 --> 01:05:40.470
Yes he is here

01:05:40.970 --> 01:05:42.550
Last room on the second floor

01:05:48.350 --> 01:05:51.640
Ahjusshi, this is Moo Deok

01:06:18.380 --> 01:06:19.380
Ahjusshi...

01:06:32.270 --> 01:06:33.730
Master Li

01:06:33.810 --> 01:06:36.610
If you were Master So Kyung's student,

01:06:36.690 --> 01:06:38.730
then now you are over a hundred years old

01:06:38.820 --> 01:06:41.440
How did you survive like this?

01:06:42.030 --> 01:06:45.160
How many years would you give me?

01:06:46.360 --> 01:06:48.870
A little over thirty

01:06:48.950 --> 01:06:51.580
Forty years at most

01:06:52.410 --> 01:06:56.080
You're right. This is my biological age

01:06:57.000 --> 01:06:57.960
What?

01:06:58.040 --> 01:07:00.840
My soul is a hundred years old

01:07:01.420 --> 01:07:04.420
The body I was born with has long since turned to dust

01:07:04.510 --> 01:07:07.180
This body didn't belong to me

01:07:09.390 --> 01:07:10.260
Wait a minute

01:07:11.010 --> 01:07:13.770
So you are a nomad?

01:07:13.850 --> 01:07:14.850
Yes

01:07:15.890 --> 01:07:18.270
I'm a nomad

01:07:26.950 --> 01:07:28.240
Your Majesty,

01:07:28.320 --> 01:07:32.450
You called me to find another nomad?

01:07:33.040 --> 01:07:34.200
I'll find him

01:07:34.870 --> 01:07:38.170
I can tell who is a nomad

01:07:49.510 --> 01:07:53.560
He knew from the very beginning that Moo Deok was a nomad

01:08:18.710 --> 01:08:19.580
It's you

01:08:20.790 --> 01:08:22.380
killed him

01:08:41.380 --> 01:09:01.860
Thanks for watching with us!
doramamania

01:09:01.860 --> 01:09:04.840
Alchemy

01:09:01.860 --> 01:09:04.840
Shower

01:09:04.920 --> 01:09:06.550
Why are there so many corpses here?

01:09:06.630 --> 01:09:09.050
What kind of life did Moo Deok lead?

01:09:09.130 --> 01:09:11.930
Moo Deok is hiding something

01:09:12.010 --> 01:09:14.800
- What cannot be revealed
- Mommies!

01:09:15.680 --> 01:09:17.640
Instead he will start barking

01:09:18.390 --> 01:09:22.100
As I thought, there is more than one nomad in the palace

01:09:22.190 --> 01:09:24.690
If it turns out that the King's star is a creation of dark magic,

01:09:24.770 --> 01:09:27.190
The pine forest will come to an end

01:09:27.730 --> 01:09:28.570
It's dangerous

01:09:28.650 --> 01:09:31.240
You don't know her, but she knows Moo Deok

01:09:31.320 --> 01:09:32.490
We need Chang Gan

01:09:32.570 --> 01:09:35.080
We will wait for his return

01:09:36.370 --> 01:09:37.950
Moo Deok, why are you here?

01:09:38.040 --> 01:09:40.250
I can't leave my master

01:09:40.330 --> 01:09:43.500
Love me until I die
